{
  "format": "pinmame-harness-scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "game": "robowars",
  "notes": "Fresh empty NVRAM; binary output mode; HandleMechanics 0; no keyboard; direct canonical System 80B decimal switches. Factory self-test order from printed folios 8-12: Self Test enters bookkeeping, the credit button starts step 16 lamp test, which passes to step 17 relay and solenoid test; Self Test then advances to steps 18-21. The switch test closes each matrix address in turn except 07 Self Test, 47 Replay and the flipper-copied 06/16, which are driven through 114/112. Host input is stimulus, not physical evidence.",
